+# Dovecot binds wg0 and dummy0 addresses (192.168.204.254,
+# fd33:5692:1834:204::254, 192.168.254.254, fd33:5692:1834:254::254) for
+# managesieve. If an address is not yet configured the bind fails and dovecot
+# refuses to start - the same trap that catches Postfix, and for the same
+# reason.
